\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Surrounded by a host of foes,
\par Stormed by a host of foes within,
\par Nor swift to flee, nor strong to oppose,
\par Single, against hell, earth, and sin,
\par Single, yet undismayed, I am:
\par I dare believe in Jesu's name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. What though a thousand hosts engage,
\par A thousand worlds, my soul to shake?
\par I have a shield shall quell their rage,
\par And drive the alien armies back;
\par Portrayed it bears a bleeding Lamb:
\par I dare believe in Jesu's name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Me to retrieve from Satan's hands,
\par Me from this evil world to free,
\par To purge my sins, and loose my bands,
\par And save from all iniquity,
\par My Lord and God from heaven He came:
\par I dare believe in Jesu's name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Salvation in His name there is,
\par Salvation from sin, death, and hell,
\par Salvation into glorious bliss,
\par How great salvation, who can tell?
\par But all He hath for mine I claim:
\par I dare believe in Jesu's name.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
